@startuml
title Job｜單一步驟執行狀態
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft JhengHei
hide empty description
state "排隊中 / queued" as queued
state "執行中 / running" as running
state "待補資料 / blocked" as blocked
state "執行失敗 / failed" as failed
state "執行成功 / succeeded" as succeeded
[*] --> queued : 建立工作
queued --> running : 取得執行鎖 / 記錄 attempt
running --> blocked : 必要輸入不足 / 列出缺口
blocked --> queued : 人補齊資料並要求重跑
running --> failed : 工具錯誤／程序中斷 / 保存錯誤
failed --> queued : 要求重試 [問題已處理]
running --> succeeded : 執行完成 / 保存輸出路徑
succeeded --> [*]
@enduml